&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Restaurants run on a stack of tools that rarely talk to each other: one for delivery, another for online orders, another for reservations, another for loyalty, and a till that knows nothing about any of them. The same guest can look like three different customers across three different systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DashOS is DoorDash&#39;s platform for fixing that. It connects marketplace ordering, direct ordering, reservations, loyalty, guest management, marketing and point of sale around one shared view of the guest, so every product gets smarter as the others are used. DoorDash launched DashOS publicly at Dash Forward in September 2026, and from 2027 more than 80,000 restaurants on leading POS and middleware partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DashOS Engineering brings together engineers from across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt into one global organisation, led from London. Our teams cover reservations and guest CRM, digital ordering and omnichannel loyalty, POS and self-order kiosks, AI-powered marketing and Voice AI, and the shared data and integration platforms that connect them. Each team owns its own roadmap. The shared mission is making them work as one system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a backend-focused Software Engineer to build the high-performance, highly available services that restaurants depend on every day, from booking a table on a Friday night to recognising a regular the moment they order. You&#39;ll work closely with other engineers, product managers and designers, and because DashOS is newly launched, you&#39;ll help shape how its products connect rather than inheriting decisions someone else already made.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, deploy and improve backend services for customer-facing features used by restaurants and their guests in markets around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features end to end, from technical design through to launch and ongoing support, including taking part in an on-call rotation to keep systems reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on hard problems in data, latency and scale: unifying guest identity across channels, real-time availability search across thousands of venues, and integrations with the systems restaurants already run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on DoorDash&#39;s global platform, so the features you ship can reach restaurants across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt markets rather than being rebuilt for each one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a modern engineering environment with frequent daily releases, feature flags and AI coding agents used across code review, deployment and debugging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineers, product managers and designers across London and other DashOS locations to decide what to build and how.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years of professional software engineering experience, and a degree in Computer Science or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built and operated backend services or web applications in production, with strong fundamentals in data structures, algorithms and system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re fluent in at least one modern backend language (we mostly use Python), and you&#39;re happy to pick up new languages and tools as the platform evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about the people using what you build, and you take ownership of technical solutions from first design to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI coding tools as part of how you work, or you&#39;re keen to, and you&#39;re comfortable reviewing and taking responsibility for what they produce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy collaborating with cross-functional teams to solve problems that don&#39;t have an obvious answer yet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech you&#39;ll work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our services are built mainly in Python, with performance-critical systems in Rust, running on Google Cloud and DoorDash&#39;s global platform. AI coding agents are part of how we design, review and ship code, so we care more about how you solve problems than about which languages you&#39;ve used before. You won&#39;t need to know every part of the stack on day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where and how we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our London office at The River Building, on a hybrid pattern of 3 days a week in the office.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SevenRooms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2011, Joel Montaniel, Allison Page, and Kinesh Patel founded SevenRooms after noticing that hospitality operators were missing a critical ingredient in the systems they were using to run their business: guest data. What began as a mission to help restaurants better understand and serve their guests evolved into a powerful platform used by merchants around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With best-in-class tools for marketing, operations, and guest experience — all deeply integrated with its industry-leading CRM — SevenRooms empowers operators to drive revenue, streamline operations, and deliver experiences that keep guests coming back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2025, DoorDash acquired SevenRooms to strengthen its in-store strategy and expand its merchant-first offerings. The combination brings together DoorDash’s scale, reach, and digital innovation with SevenRooms’ in-store capabilities to support hospitality businesses across every channel — from discovery and delivery to on-premise dining.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As DoorDash builds out its in-store capabilities, SevenRooms plays a central role in enabling merchants to grow their businesses and connect more meaningfully with guests, whether they’re ordering online or dining in. This move reflects DoorDash’s broader commitment to empowering local businesses, fostering stronger connections between consumers and the places they love, and building technology that meets merchants — and their customers — wherever they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;148&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;150&quot; data-end=&quot;229&quot;&gt;Build the framework support that helps AI developers unlock Graphcore hardware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;231&quot; data-end=&quot;458&quot;&gt;You will help Graphcore accelerators work seamlessly with state-of-the-art ML frameworks, including Triton and PyTorch. Reporting to a Team Lead in Frameworks, you will design, implement, optimise and support critical software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;Your work will shape how researchers and engineers use Graphcore hardware for demanding machine learning workloads. You will improve performance, quality and usability across a complex software stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;662&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;You will join our Triton team, delivering new features, reviewing code, writing technical documentation and working with upstream communities. You will also help coordinate open-ended technical work across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;This role offers deep technical ownership and visible impact as the ML software landscape evolves. You will keep learning and may contribute across other framework teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1068&quot;&gt;The team and culture&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1261&quot;&gt;The Frameworks team connects Graphcore hardware with the tools ML engineers and researchers rely on. We work across PyTorch, Triton, JAX and TensorFlow, focusing on usability and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1263&quot; data-end=&quot;1436&quot;&gt;Work happens through agile practices, close technical discussion and clear ownership. Engineers are trusted to speak up, solve hard problems and move work forward with pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;1613&quot;&gt;Decisions are shaped by evidence, code quality and business outcomes. You will work across Graphcore and with open-source communities to deliver software developers can trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1615&quot; data-end=&quot;1637&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1639&quot; data-end=&quot;2099&quot;&gt;· Strong software engineering skills, with the judgement to manage quality, complexity and technical debt.&lt;br&gt;· Experience developing in Python and C++.&lt;br&gt;· Experience in compiler development.&lt;br&gt;· Ability to manage complex technical tasks with cross-team dependencies.&lt;br&gt;· Clear communication skills, with a proactive approach to collaboration and technical leadership.&lt;br&gt;· Interest in AI, ML frameworks, performance optimisation or computationally intensive engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2315&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2325&quot; data-end=&quot;3113&quot;&gt;· Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;br&gt;· Generous leave: Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;br&gt;· Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;br&gt;· Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;br&gt;· Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;br&gt;· Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;br&gt;· Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;br&gt;· Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3115&quot; data-end=&quot;3477&quot;&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;br&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;3650&quot; data-end=&quot;3676&quot;&gt;Join the Team at Graphcore&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3678&quot; data-end=&quot;3957&quot;&gt;Graphcore is one of the world’s leading innovators in Artificial Intelligence compute. It is developing hardware, software and systems infrastructure that will unlock the next generation of AI breakthroughs and power the widespread adoption of AI solutions across every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3959&quot; data-end=&quot;4241&quot;&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, Graphcore is a member of an elite family of companies responsible for some of the world’s most transformative technologies. Together, they share a bold vision: to enable Artificial Super Intelligence and ensure its benefits are accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4243&quot; data-end=&quot;4565&quot;&gt;Graphcore’s teams are drawn from diverse backgrounds and bring a broad range of skills and perspectives. A melting pot of AI research specialists, silicon designers, software engineers and systems architects, Graphcore brings together deep expertise to solve complex problems and deliver meaningful progress in AI compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4567&quot; data-end=&quot;4710&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;If you want to shape the frameworks developers use to push AI compute forward, we’d love to hear from you. Apply now to be part of the journey.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Bristol, London or Edinburgh (hybrid, three days a week in the office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Level: Senior Engineer II (TL1)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team: Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contract: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting To: Software Engineering Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a technology community of product-focused and data-led product and platform engineers working at scale. We have a diverse ecosystem, spanning TypeScript on AWS, Go on GCP and Scala, we index on product-minded problem solving over language purity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Engineer you’ll own a slice of the product end-to-end, from design through to production, and you’ll build AI coding agents as your default. We’re looking for someone whose judgement is worth more than their typing speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From your first day you’ll have paid access to Claude Code, with a budget we don’t ration, and access to the systems you need through MCP. Our tools and conventions evolve quickly, and you’ll directly impact how we build from here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a slice of the product end to end: &lt;/strong&gt;shape the problem with product and design, build the interface and the services behind it, ship it, and run it in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work across the stack over time&lt;/strong&gt;: depending on the team you’ll work across the interface people use, the services behind it, and the APIs between them, in whatever stack your team runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build with AI coding agents as your default&lt;/strong&gt;: Break work down so agents can execute, direct them, and review their output as carefully as you’d review a colleague’s pull request. You’ll also maintain the tests and safeguards that let agent written code merge safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay close to the people who use what you build: &lt;/strong&gt;directly or through our forward-deployed engineers: a supplier’s operations team, a customer plugging in a car at night. Instrument what you ship so you can see how it’s used, and turn what you learn into shipped changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make good work the default: &lt;/strong&gt;shape the codebase, conventions and automated checks so that agents and new teammates produce the right thing without anyone catching it in review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor the team around you:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach and mentor your peers and help improve how we work and evolve as a team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These are the practices and behaviours we see most in our top engineers and value deeply, but we don&#39;t expect everyone to tick every single box. If you&#39;re excited by the role and can see yourself thriving here, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience shipping production software:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a depth of experience in either a front-end or back-end of a modern stack, and potentially an openness to stretch across both as you navigate our diverse ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI coding tools:&lt;/strong&gt; You build with tools like Cursor or Claude Code, can walk us through work you’ve shipped this way and review AI output as rigorously as a colleague’s pull request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Able to navigate a complex, high-stakes domain:&lt;/strong&gt; You keep complex energy logic legible across microservices, knowing exactly when to use sync vs async to prevent cascading failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud and operational ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable deploying on major cloud platforms using shared tooling. You fully own your software in production, which includes participating in an out-of-hours on-call rota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product sense.&lt;/strong&gt; You ask the “why” before building, and you can describe a time when user feedback or metrics changed what you shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear written communication.&lt;/strong&gt; You write specs, pull request descriptions and post-mortems with enough clarity and context that either a human teammate or an AI agent can immediately act on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A multiplier for your team:&lt;/strong&gt; You mentor peers and proactively shape how the team works; introducing conventions, checks or shared context that makes everyone else’s output consistently better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be great if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building tooling around coding agents, such as MCP servers, skills or CI checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in energy, or another real-time or regulated field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off and family:&lt;/strong&gt; 26 days’ holiday, plus 26 weeks’ full pay for new parents with no qualifying service period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and security:&lt;/strong&gt; Private medical insurance with virtual GP, life assurance, pension scheme, free mortgage advice and eye tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay and flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, a Flex Fund of 5% of salary to spend on the benefits you want most, retail discounts through Perks at Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and setup:&lt;/strong&gt; Personal learning budget, home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Climate:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to Furthr, our climate action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires an existing right to work in the UK. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. Our Applicant Data Protection Policy is&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;page&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;layoutArea&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy Health is looking for a highly organised and proactive Senior Account Executive to join our Medical Communications team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will sit within a high-profile global neurology and immunology account, supporting the delivery of scientifically robust, strategically aligned programmes that help improve outcomes for patients and healthcare professionals worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring projects are delivered efficiently, on time and to the highest standard. You will work closely with clients, scientific colleagues, healthcare professionals and cross-functional agency teams, taking ownership of project delivery while developing your strategic, scientific and client management expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for an ambitious medical communications professional looking to accelerate their career as part of a collaborative, scientifically driven and creatively focused team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day delivery of a global neurology and immunology account, ensuring projects are delivered on time, on budget and to the highest standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with clients, healthcare professionals and internal teams, becoming a trusted and reliable partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate a wide range of medical communications activities, from publications and medical education programmes to congresses, advisory boards and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with scientific, creative and digital colleagues to bring complex science to life in meaningful ways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of project plans, timelines and budgets, proactively managing priorities and keeping programmes moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop your therapy area expertise and contribute to strategic discussions that help shape client programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and mentor junior team members while continuing to grow your own medical communications career.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a medical communications, healthcare communications or healthcare agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen interest in science, healthcare and the pharmaceutical industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with cross-functional teams and a range of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a proactive, solutions-focused mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness and an understanding of budgets and project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative approach and a desire to learn and develop within a fast-paced agency environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;How We’ll Support You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ogilvy celebrates its people. Fully. Enthusiastically. Unhesitatingly. We’ll empower you with the tools you’ll need to succeed. We’ll give you the autonomy to seek out new paths and better ways of doing things. We’ll support you with colleagues who are experts in their disciplines, drawn from across the Ogilvy network. And we’ll provide opportunities for you to do work of which you’ll be proud, with people you’ll be proud to call your teammates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Private Medical Cover OR Monthly Leisure Allowance (£45!) OR Dental Cover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;25 days annual leave, plus a day off for your birthday and a paid volunteering day&lt;/li&gt;
